"What kind of person kills a little girl? You digust me."
"Poor bug just wanted some shiny scrap, and ye killed em! I knew yer the worst employee, but yer also a terrible person!"
"Ye killed a harmless toy box, and you think yer strong? Bah!"
"Ye call us monsters, but then ye go and kill a BABY!? What a digusting creature you are."
"Ye see a sick employee, and instead of trying to cure em, you kill em? You really ARE the worst!"
"Oh, look at me! I'm an employee, I'm so strong that I kill toys! Hahahaha!"
"Ye must be a special kind of wimp to feel threatened by jello!"
"Yer so ugly, I think that spider died just from lookin at ya. Hahahaha!"
