[line]

[size=5][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Enhanced Monsters[/b] - sets sensible default values for Enhanced Monsters.
[*][b]Coroner[/b] - specific voice lines for Coroner causes of death, plus a custom cause of death message for the Gargoyle himself. The installer offers this as a tick box.
[*][b]Employee Classes[/b] - adds a taunt for each class.
[/list]

[line]

[size=5][b]Feedback and Requests[/b][/size]

Voice line suggestions are genuinely welcome, plenty of the lines above came from players.

[list]
[*][b]GitHub:[/b] [url=https://github.com/DropDaDeuce/LethalGargoyles]github.com/DropDaDeuce/LethalGargoyles[/url]
[*][b]Lethal Company Modding Discord[/b]
[/list]

This is my first experience with Unity, C#, modeling and animation. Any suggestions for improvement are welcome.

